      "result": "Implemented the persistent URL shortener. It uses chi 5.2.1 and PostgreSQL via `DATABASE_URL`; startup creates the links table, and redirect clicks are incremented atomically.\n\n`sh start.sh` applies the schema and serves on `0.0.0.0:8000`. The README includes startup instructions.\n\nVerified with `go test ./...`, `go vet ./...`, and an HTTP smoke test covering creation, duplicate codes, redirects and click tracking, retrieval, listing, and malformed JSON. The smoke test used the configured PostgreSQL database.",
